sequenceDiagram
    participant Patient
    participant API as Monovella API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Nomba
    participant Sub as Provider Nomba sub-account

    Patient->>API: start checkout for booking or order
    API->>DB: create payment_attempt (pending) + slot_hold
    API->>Nomba: create order with configured split
    Note over Nomba: split allocates provider share to Sub,<br/>platform share stays on Monovella's merchant account
    Nomba-->>Patient: hosted checkout page
    Patient->>Nomba: pays
    Nomba-->>Sub: settles provider share directly
    Nomba-->>API: signed webhook (payment success)
    API->>API: verify signature, re-query transaction
    API->>DB: mark payment_attempt verified (idempotent)
    API->>DB: confirm booking or paid order

    alt hold expired before verification
        API->>Nomba: trigger refund (API-initiated, no provider action needed)
        Nomba-->>Patient: refund
        API->>DB: raise Alert only if the refund attempt itself fails
    end
